1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,440
Greetings, Senior.

25
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:09,360
Qiu Siping\NLate Stage Core Formation

26
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:09,760
So there really is someone skilled in ancient restrictions.

27
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,400
Ancient restrictions ?

28
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,880
Senior, can you help me ?

29
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,000
It's not that difficult

30
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,120
but you must tell me

31
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:23,520
who placed this restriction on you.

32
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,960
If Senior can break it,

33
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,720
Junior will tell you everything.

34
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,160
I’ll give it a try then.

35
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,680
What is this !?

36
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,360
I won't let you go !

37
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,480
I must use this beast

38
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:17,400
to lure out the person who knows ancient restrictions.

39
00:03:58,720 --> 00:04:00,120
Fellow cultivator can calm down.

40
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:02,080
You must be the one

41
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:04,240
who placed this ancient restriction.

42
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:07,760
Fellow cultivator, I don't have any any malicious intent.

43
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:10,240
I have an opportunity to offer you.

44
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,400
We're complete strangers

45
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,680
about to fight each other to death.

46
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:18,080
Why should I trust you ?

47
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:20,240
To be honest,

48
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,640
we’re both Late stage Core Formation

49
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,640
hoping to form a Nascent Soul.

50
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:28,640
If fellow cultivator is willing to lend me a hand,

51
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:29,600
I can guarantee

52
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,920
that fellow cultivator will be able to form a Nascent Soul.

53
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,280
I know where

54
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:39,040
you can devour a defenseless Nascent Soul

55
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:42,880
to greatly increase your chance of forming your Nascent Soul.

56
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,360
I know of a place

57
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:48,760
where 2 Nascent Souls are in sleeping.

58
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:50,320
If we succeed,

59
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,080
both of us

60
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:54,400
will get a Nascent Soul to absorb.

61
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,080
What do you think ?

62
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:05,160
How do you know about these Nascent Souls ?

63
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:09,080
One of them

64
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,640
is my Senior Brother.

65
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:14,040
The other is my master.

66
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,280
Killing your own teacher ?

67
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,720
Nothing unusual,

68
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,640
I’ve done that before.

69
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:23,160
Master wanted to increase his cultivation

70
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:25,120
so he planned to refine me.

71
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:27,400
He thought I was clueless

72
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:30,920
but I had seen through his scheme long ago.

73
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:33,480
30 years ago,

74
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:35,840
while he was in seclusion with my Senior Brother,

75
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,920
I sabotaged them during cultivation

76
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,520
to make them fall asleep.

77
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:41,120
It's been a few days

78
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:43,880
since their consciousness were consumed by inner demons.

79
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:47,360
It's the best time to absorb their Nascent Souls.

80
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:50,840
What does this have to do with ancient restrictions ?

81
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,160
They cultivated

82
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,480
in an ancient cultivator's cave.

83
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,680
It contains too many restrictions.

84
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,840
If you trigger one, you trigger them all.

85
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,600
If I force my way in,

86
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,400
there might be nothing left for me to obtain.

87
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:12,160
That’s why I need fellow cultivator’s help.

88
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:15,240
Master is Early stage Nascent Soul

89
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,120
and Senior Brother had just broken through.

90
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,400
If fellow cultivator can open the restrictions,

91
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,520
then Master’s Nascent Soul

92
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,800
will be yours.

93
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,280
We're almost there.

94
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,000
It's right here.

95
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:46,720
Entering this gate will trigger a restriction.

96
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:49,520
I leave everything to fellow cultivator.

97
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:05,160
This beast is condensed from spiritual energy.

98
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,800
As long as the stone wall keeps supplying energy,

99
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,280
it cannot be killed !

100
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,440
While fighting it,

101
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:14,520
hidden restrictions in the walls will also launch attacks

102
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,480
that are hard to defend against !

103
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,440
Fellow cultivator, let's first destroy those walls !

104
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,240
Fighting this beast is useless !

105
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,440
As expected,

106
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,440
it wasn't the walls powering the beast

107
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:37,240
but the beast supplying the entire restriction.

108
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,240
Hiding the restriction's core here

109
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:43,360
really is the work of a restriction master.

110
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,080
However,

111
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:48,600
compared to the Ancient God's restrictions,

112
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,160
it's too weak.

113
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:57,240
Fellow cultivator’s knowledge in restrictions

114
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,680
is really something else !

115
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:09,040
An Ancient Teleportation Formation ?

116
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,360
Fellow cultivator,

117
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:16,080
Master and Senior Brother are inside this chamber.

118
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:31,840
Fellow cultivator, farewell !

119
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,080
Now,

120
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:37,040
after I craft the Restriction Flag

121
00:08:37,040 --> 00:08:38,720
I will form my Nascent Soul.

122
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:39,720
I need to place 999 restrictions on this flag

123
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:42,080
to refine a Restriction Flag of the lowest level.

124
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:06,920
2 days later

125
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,360
I did it !

126
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:34,920
What’s going on !?

127
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,000
Could it be ?

128
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:48,560
Look !

129
00:10:58,040 --> 00:11:00,360
Divine Retribution ? How is this possible ?

130
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,880
Since the ancient cultivation world was destroyed,

131
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,720
Divine Retribution ceased to appear.

132
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:07,520
Could it be an ancient artifact ?

133
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,880
That would be excellent nourishment

134
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,560
Such massive tribulation clouds...

135
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,840
It must be the appearance of a supreme artifact !

136
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:46,040
Ancient Gods often triggered Divine Retribution.

137
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:48,240
The stronger the tribulation,

138
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:50,200
the more powerful the artifact.

139
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:53,200
This tribulation is here to destroy the Restriction Flag !

140
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,480
Now or never !

141
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:17,760
My Golden Core can barely withstand this lightning.

142
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:19,920
If this continues, it will shatter.

143
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:22,680
I need to cultivate right now.

144
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:33,080
Hand over the ancient artifact

145
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,200
and I'll spare your life !

146
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,480
Hand over the artifact !

147
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,480
Be reasonable !

148
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:04,640
You can’t escape !

149
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:05,480
Hand over the artifact !

150
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:32,920
Nothing I ever wanted has ever escaped my grasp !

151
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:36,480
Nascent Soul ?

152
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:38,800
Little brat, die !

153
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:16,040
Break !

154
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:22,800
Search for him !

155
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,600
A mere Late stage Core Formation

156
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,600
couldn't have vanished into thin air !

157
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:43,200
Find him !

158
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:45,880
Dig into the ground if you must !

159
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:48,360
Since you all tried to kill me,

160
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:52,000
then you can't blame me for it !

161
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:57,840
Divine Sense, disperse !

162
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:16,640
He instantly killed 100 people !?

163
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:17,640
Retreat !

164
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,960
Wang Lin\NPeak Late stage Core Formation

165
00:16:57,640 --> 00:16:59,880
What kind of luck does this guy have !?

166
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:01,640
Not only did he survive the Divine Retribution

167
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:04,400
but he also reached Peak Late stage Core Formation !

168
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:05,880
Damn it !

169
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:08,240
Who can I even complain to ?

170
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:13,520
Congratulations Master,

171
00:17:13,520 --> 00:17:15,400
you turned that misfortune into fortune !

172
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,600
If you devour this Nascent Soul

173
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:18,160
you will reach Nascent Soul for sure !

174
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:24,120
The Ji Realm will overpower your peers of the same level.

175
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,240
But it also limits the user.

176
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,000
There has never been

177
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,560
a Ji Realm user who has broken through

178
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,360
above the level of Nascent Soul.

179
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:34,160
You won't be able to reach higher levels.

180
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:39,840
My cultivation will stop at Nascent Soul...

181
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:42,400
But I refuse to accept it !

182
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:38,160
All the stars were aligned

183
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:42,400
but the Ji Realm still prevented me from breaking through !

184
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:45,160
My success comes from the Ji Realm

185
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:47,200
and now my downfall comes from the Ji Realm !

186
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:53,280
Master... Fate is unpredictable...

187
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:54,360
You..

188
00:18:57,280 --> 00:18:59,680
I never believed in fate !

189
00:19:03,230 --> 00:21:18,800
A Divine Retribution is the manifestation of the heavens' rejection towards something. The heavens send a tribulation to eradicate what they don't allow to exist. They appear as tribulation clouds that strike lightining to destroy whatever it is that defied the heavens.\N\NIf the person or object passes the tribulation, it is allowed to exist. Depending on the level of defiance towards the heavens, they can send either a single lightining or multiple clouds with ascending difficulty.\N\NA heaven defying artifact like the Restriction Flag can cause a tribulation to fall but since it was only the first level of 999 restriction is was weak enough be passed with a little help from Wang Lin.\N\NAs the tribulation lighting invaded his body, Wang Lin had no choice but to kill the hundreds of cultivators to swallow their Golden Cores in order to stabilize his cultivation and refine that lightning. That is only possible thanks to the Ancient God Tactic that allows him to devour absurd amounts of spiritual energy without his body exploding.\N\NWhat isn't said here is that he now has a refined tribulation lightning inside his body that he can use to call the tribulation back.

190
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:15,400
I've had my share of wounds,

191
00:19:13,560 --> 00:19:15,400
now I want to fight back.

192
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:18,960
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

193
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:24,880
that's blocking all my hopes

194
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:24,880
for life ?

195
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:30,640
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

196
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:30,640
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

197
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:34,040
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

198
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:40,040
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

199
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:40,040
out of reach.

200
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:45,520
Immortals

201
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:45,520
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

202
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:49,560
Renegades

203
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:49,560
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

204
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:53,400
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

205
00:19:51,510 --> 00:19:53,400
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

206
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:57,520
because I don't see the harm in that.

207
00:19:59,520 --> 00:20:05,320
My new body opens its eyes

208
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:05,320
and awakens from its dream.

209
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:12,880
I have overcome many trials

210
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:12,880
to get this body back.

211
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:20,520
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

212
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:20,520
I can still see.

213
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:29,880
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

214
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:29,880
by my own hands.

215
00:20:45,320 --> 00:20:51,280
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

216
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:51,280
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

217
00:20:51,280 --> 00:20:58,840
With a flick of a finger,

218
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:58,840
only my indomitable heart remains.

219
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:08,240
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

220
00:21:04,840 --> 00:21:08,240
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

221
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:16,080
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

222
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:16,080
like the descent of a god.
